* Base modulation isolated fixture; ideal RF source only
VSUP vcc 0 5
VRF out 0 SIN(0 1 31meg)
.model 2N3904   NPN(Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259
+               Ise=6.734f Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5 Br=.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1
+               Cjc=3.638p Mjc=.3085 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=4.493p Mje=.2593 Vje=.75
+               Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10)

VMOD vm 0 PULSE(0.0748175 1.0748175 20u 20n 20n 1.498e-05 50u)

* RF attenuation/coupling to base; no uncontrolled floating transistor terminal.
RMRF out mrftap 2200
RMRG mrftap 0 10
CMRF mrftap mb 1e-10
* DC-coupled base injection: no duty-dependent coupling-capacitor baseline.
RMT vcc mb 15000
RMB mb 0 3300
RMINJ vm mb 47000
QM mc mb me 2N3904
RMC vcc mc 1000
RME me 0 470
CME me 0 1e-09
* TP3 is the AC-coupled MODULATOR output, not automatically v3.
CMOUT mc tp3 1e-10
RTP3DC tp3 0 1000
* Explicit output follower and final AC-coupled connector.
CBUF tp3 ob 1e-10
ROBT vcc ob 33000
ROBB ob 0 33000
QOB vcc ob oe 2N3904
ROE oe 0 330
COV3 oe v3 10n
* Measurement fixture, NOT a specified antenna or course load.
RTEST v3 0 10000
CTEST v3 0 5e-12
.options method=trap maxord=2 reltol=1e-5 trtol=7 temp=27 tnom=27
.control
set filetype=binary
set num_threads=1
save v(out) v(vm) v(mb) v(me) v(mc) v(tp3) v(oe) v(ob) v(v3) i(vsup) i(vmod)
tran 0.5n 0.0003 0.00015 0.5n 
write matrix2_a1_d30.raw
quit
.endc
.end
